[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=HORUS
Name[en]=HORUS
Name[fr]=HORUS
Name[es]=HORUS
Name[de]=HORUS
Comment=Occhio OSINT globale: feed mondiali su mappa e ricognizione locale
Comment[en]=Global OSINT eye: worldwide feeds on a map and local recon
Comment[fr]=Œil OSINT global : flux mondiaux sur carte et reconnaissance locale
Comment[es]=Ojo OSINT global: feeds mundiales en mapa y reconocimiento local
Comment[de]=Globales OSINT-Auge: weltweite Feeds auf Karte und lokale Aufklärung
Exec=nxs-horus
Icon=nxs-horus
Terminal=false
Categories=Network;Security;
Actions=cyber;disastri;trasporti;geopolitica;

[Desktop Action cyber]
